      501.22,
      549.78,
      548.29
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Paragraph (4) of Article 24 of the Constitution of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka I, Wijeyadasa Rajapakshe, Minister of Justice, Prison A\ufb00 airs and Constitutional Reforms, with the concurrence of the Cabinet of Ministers, do by this direction permit the use of the English Language for all purposes in or in relation to the records and proceedings in the Courts speci\ufb01 ed in the Schedule hereto.",
